          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore pooki toki naikurtutari ti oriong enkop naa keiduruk; meinosi ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore entoki naba anaa enalo te nkoshoke enye aashu pooki nalo too nkejek ong'uan aashu pooki toki naata nkejek kumok, nena tokitin pooki naaikurtutari ti oriong enkop, eminya ake, amu olminong ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emintaa ake ate olminong te pooki toki naikurtutari; nimindurukiekie ate te ninche, pee miakuku ake ilolminong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 19.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 1.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu ara nanu Olaitoriani Enkai inyi, entisinya naa ate, pee iakuku sinyat amu kara nanu sinyati. Emindurukie ake ate tiae toki naikurtutari neiserpepiari ti oriong enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ara nanu Olaitoriani ilo apa oitayio intae aitung'uaa enkop e Misiri, pee aaku Enkai inyi, entaa naa sinyat, amu kara nanu sinyati.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
